```text
• Allen Test – checking for adequate 
perfusion to the hand
• Occlude both the radial and ulnar arteries.  
Have patient make a fist/open hand several 
times.  Release occlusion over radial artery.  
Monitor hand color.  
• Repeat for Ulnar Artery.
